==English==

==={{acronym}}===
'''FYROM'''

# The [[former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia]]

====Usage notes====

Although the word "former" is intentionally not capitalized, as it is a "provisional designator", not the title for the state, the acronym "FYROM" is often used. It would more properly be "fYROM", but that is an awkward construction that is rarely used.

